# Ask every edge node to revalidate HTML, so a deploy propagates sooner. This
# narrows the stale-HTML window but does NOT close it — responses still come
# back CF-Cache-Status: HIT with old content for a few minutes after a deploy.
# Don't trust a single post-deploy curl; see the CDN-cache notes in CLAUDE.md.
# Images live on Cloudinary, so this only affects the small HTML/favicon assets
# the Worker serves.
/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache
